OL,3,GNEWSAAction urged over unauthorised
OL,4,Atraveller camps
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has submitted a motion
OL,7,Fcalling for tougher action on
OL,8,Fanti-social vehicle use and
OL,9,Funauthorised Gypsy and traveller camps
OL,10,Fin Leeds.
OL,12,FKieran White, who represents Reform UK
OL,13,Fon the city council, warned a "serious
OL,14,Fincident" could happen without further
OL,15,Faction.
OL,17,FThe motion, which will be voted on
OL,18,Flater, highlights "delays in the courts
OL,19,Fof removing people quickly and giving
OL,20,Fthe police confidence in dealing with a
OL,21,Fsensitive issue," he added.
