OL,3,GNEWSAAction urged over unauthorised
OL,4,Atraveller camps
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month plans were approved to
OL,7,Finstall barriers and bollards at
OL,8,FRoundhay Park to deter illegal
OL,9,Fencampments, following repeated
OL,10,Fconcerns from residents about criminal
OL,11,Fdamage and their safety.
